+	 * Explicitly use a 32-bit btsl instead of test_and_set_bit(), which
+	 * would use btsq on x86-64. The vcpu_info is guest-controlled and only
+	 * required to be 32-bit aligned, so a 64-bit access could generate a
+	 * split-lock #AC.
+	 *
